    { "id": "note-final", "x": -400, "y": 0, "w": 320, "page": "page-1", "text": "JUMBOTRON · FINAL\nScoreboard structure from C with Stadium Night's palette: void #070910, gold #FFB800 LED digits, live mint #00E5A0, alert red #FF3B5C.\n\nColor comes from the teams: the My Game board bleeds both team colors in from its edges, every score row has team-color edge bars, guide rows carry a channel-brand stripe, league headers get a league-color tick, and the setup panel tints toward your #1 team." },
    { "id": "note-a", "x": -400, "y": 0,    "w": 320, "page": "page-2", "text": "A · STADIUM NIGHT\nCurrent brand pushed toward broadcast graphics. Palette carried into the final." },
